        "TileImage": "$($repository 776cd9fa-8f7b-42e2-9ed9-72328631a867).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, 47!\rA disturbing situation has come to our attention at the Gama Medical Facility in Hokkaido, Japan. Sakura Sushi, a revered restaurant known for its culinary mastery, has been exploiting the vulnerable patients within the facility to profit from their ailments. It appears that the chefs have intentionally been serving contaminated sushi, exacerbating the patients&apos; illnesses in an attempt to generate additional financial gain. Our client seeks clear retribution.\r\rGood luck!",
